      ],
      "en": "This is the third time I am coming to you. “At the mouth of two or three witnesses shall every word be established.”",
      "ko": "내가 이제 세 번째 너희에게 갈터이니 두세 증인의 입으로 말마다 확정하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "e8611389ab6772ab143528b70cf1ac82eccca8a0ed56528976a74f2112e97f9b",
      "translation_text_hash": "881cc41b5182ff68f97fbcb1b8ea0f65a48874bef133d2ae3937333232dbd5d9",
